      "updated": 1778075269407,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Resume -> compact encode (single-letter keys)\n2. fflate zlib level 9 compress\n3. POST /api/share/create\n4. AES-256-GCM encrypt -> Redis SETEX\n5. Return nanoid(12) shareId -> /s/:id\n6. GET /s/:id -> Lua GET+DEL -> decrypt\n7. Decompress -> decode -> createResume",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Resume -> compact encode (single-letter keys)\n2. fflate zlib level 9 compress\n3. POST /api/share/create\n4. AES-256-GCM encrypt -> Redis SETEX\n5. Return nanoid(12) shareId -> /s/:id\n6. GET /s/:id -> Lua GET+DEL -> decrypt\n7. Decompress -> decode -> createResume",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    }
  ],
